{"type":"message","id":"8dd43a32","parentId":"91ce8c06","timestamp":"2026-03-07T13:53:26.917Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王说得对！OpenClaw端口确实不固定，用户可以根据需要配置不同的端口。让我更新API集成方案来支持动态端口配置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_39ecacb64ca24d44a56f948e","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dynamic_port_integration_guide.md","content":"# OpenClaw 动态端口集成指南\n\n## 🎯 动态端口支持方案\n\n### 核心挑战\n- OpenClaw端口可由用户自定义配置（默认18789，但可更改）\n- AI Soul Weaver需要动态发现OpenClaw服务端口\n- 需要支持多种配置方式和故障转移\n\n## 🔍 端口发现策略\n\n### 方案1: 配置文件读取\n```typescript\nimport { readFileSync } from 'fs';\nimport { join } from 'path';\n\nfunction discoverOpenClawPort(): number {\n  const configPaths = [\n    // 常见OpenClaw配置路径\n    join(process.env.HOME || process.env.USERPROFILE || '', '.openclaw', 'openclaw.json'),\n    join(process.cwd(), 'openclaw.json'),\n    '/etc/openclaw/openclaw.json',\n    'C:\\\\ProgramData\\\\OpenClaw\\\\openclaw.json'\n  ];\n  \n  for (const configPath of configPaths) {\n    try {\n      const config = JSON.parse(readFileSync(configPath, 'utf-8'));\n      if (config.gateway?.port) {\n        return config.gateway.port;\n      }\n    } catch (error) {\n      // 配置文件不存在或格式错误，继续尝试下一个\n      continue;\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // 默认端口\n  return 18789;\n}\n```\n\n### 方案2: 环境变量支持\n```typescript\nfunction getOpenClawPort(): number {\n  // 优先级: 环境变量 > 配置文件 > 默认值\n  const envPort = process.env.OPENCLAW_PORT || \n                 process.env.OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PORT;\n  \n  if (envPort) {\n    return parseInt(envPort, 10);\n  }\n  \n  return discoverOpenClawPort(); // 使用方案1的发现逻辑\n}\n```\n\n### 方案3: 服务发现（高级）\n```typescript\nimport * as dns from 'dns';\nimport * as net from 'net';\n\nasync function discoverOpenClawService(): Promise<{ host: string; port: number }> {\n  // 尝试常见的OpenClaw服务名称\n  const serviceNames = [\n    'openclaw',\n    'openclaw-gateway', \n    'clawd',\n    'localhost'\n  ];\n  \n  const commonPorts = [18789, 3000, 8080, 443, 80];\n  \n  for (const serviceName of serviceNames) {\n    for (const port of commonPorts) {\n      const isReachable = await checkPortReachable(serviceName, port);\n      if (isReachable) {\n        return { host: serviceName, port };\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  \n  throw new Error('OpenClaw service not found');\n}\n\nasync function checkPortReachable(host: string, port: number): Promise<boolean> {\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    const socket = new net.Socket();\n    socket.setTimeout(2000);\n    \n    socket.on('connect', () => {\n      socket.destroy();\n      resolve(true);\n    });\n    \n    socket.on('timeout', () => {\n      socket.destroy();\n      resolve(false);\n    });\n    \n    socket.on('error', () => {\n      resolve(false);\n    });\n    \n    socket.connect(port, host);\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## 🔧 配置管理\n\n### 多环境配置支持\n```typescript\ninterface OpenClawConfig {\n  host: string;\n  port: number;\n  protocol: 'http' | 'https';\n  apiVersion: string;\n  timeout: number;\n  retryAttempts: number;\n}\n\nclass OpenClawConfigManager {\n  private config: OpenClawConfig;\n  \n  constructor() {\n    this.loadConfig();\n  }\n  \n  private loadConfig() {\n    this.config = {\n      host: process.env.OPENCLAW_HOST || 'localhost',\n      port: this.getPort(),\n      protocol: process.env.OPENCLAW_PROTOCOL || 'http',\n      apiVersion: process.env.OPENCLAW_API_VERSION || 'v1',\n      timeout: parseInt(process.env.OPENCLAW_TIMEOUT || '30000', 10),\n      retryAttempts: parseInt(process.env.OPENCLAW_RETRY_ATTEMPTS || '3', 10)\n    };\n  }\n  \n  private getPort(): number {\n    // 多种端口获取方式的优先级\n    const sources = [\n      () => parseInt(process.env.OPENCLAW_PORT || '', 10),\n      () => this.discoverFromConfigFile(),\n      () => 18789 // 默认值\n    ];\n    \n    for (const source of sources) {\n      const port = source();\n      if (port && !isNaN(port)) {\n        return port;\n      }\n    }\n    \n    return 18789;\n  }\n  \n  getConfig(): OpenClawConfig {\n    return { ...this.config };\n  }\n  \n  updateConfig(newConfig: Partial<OpenClawConfig>) {\n    this.config = { ...this.config, ...newConfig };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 实时配置更新\n```typescript\nimport { watch } from 'fs';\n\nclass ConfigWatcher {\n  private configPath: string;\n  private onChange: (config: OpenClawConfig) => void;\n  \n  constructor(configPath: string, onChange: (config: OpenClawConfig) => void) {\n    this.configPath = configPath;\n    this.onChange = onChange;\n    this.startWatching();\n  }\n  \n  private startWatching() {\n    watch(this.configPath, (eventType, filename) => {\n      if (eventType === 'change' && filename) {\n        try {\n          const newConfig = this.loadConfigFromFile();\n          this.onChange(newConfig);\n          console.log('OpenClaw configuration updated');\n        } catch (error) {\n          console.warn('Failed to reload configuration:', error);\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  }\n  \n  private loadConfigFromFile(): OpenClawConfig {\n    const content = readFileSync(this.configPath, 'utf-8');\n    const config = JSON.parse(content);\n    \n    return {\n      host: 'localhost',\n      port: config.gateway?.port || 18789,\n      protocol: 'http',\n      apiVersion: 'v1',\n      timeout: 30000,\n      retryAttempts: 3\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🚀 智能客户端实现\n\n### 自适应客户端\n```typescript\nclass AdaptiveOpenClawClient {\n  private baseURL: string;\n  private configManager: OpenClawConfigManager;\n  private configWatcher?: ConfigWatcher;\n  \n  constructor() {\n    this.configManager = new OpenClawConfigManager();\n    this.baseURL = this.buildBaseURL();\n    \n    // 监听配置变化\n    this.setupConfigWatching();\n  }\n  \n  private buildBaseURL(): string {\n    const config = this.configManager.getConfig();\n    return `${config.protocol}://${config.host}:${config.port}/api/${config.apiVersion}`;\n  }\n  \n  private setupConfigWatching() {\n    const configPaths = [\n      join(process.env.HOME || '', '.openclaw', 'openclaw.json'),\n      join(process.cwd(), 'openclaw.json')\n    ];\n    \n    for (const configPath of configPaths) {\n      if (existsSync(configPath)) {\n        this.configWatcher = new ConfigWatcher(configPath, (newConfig) => {\n          this.configManager.updateConfig(newConfig);\n          this.baseURL = this.buildBaseURL();\n        });\n        break;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  \n  async request(endpoint: string, options: RequestInit = {}): Promise<any> {\n    const config = this.configManager.getConfig();\n    const url = `${this.baseURL}/${endpoint.replace(/^\\//, '')}`;\n    \n    let attempt = 0;\n    while (attempt < config.retryAttempts) {\n      try {\n        const controller = new AbortController();\n        const timeoutId = setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), config.timeout);\n        \n        const response = await fetch(url, {\n          ...options,\n          signal: controller.signal,\n          headers: {\n            'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n            ...options.headers,\n          },\n        });\n        \n        clearTimeout(timeoutId);\n        \n        if (!response.ok) {\n          throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}: ${response.statusText}`);\n        }\n        \n        return await response.json();\n        \n      } catch (error) {\n        attempt++;\n        \n        if (attempt >= config.retryAttempts) {\n          throw new Error(`Request failed after ${attempt} attempts: ${error.message}`);\n        }\n        \n        // 指数退避\n        await new Promise(resolve => \n          setTimeout(resolve, Math.pow(2, attempt) * 1000)\n        );\n        \n        // 尝试重新发现配置（端口可能改变了）\n        if (error.code === 'ECONNREFUSED') {\n          this.configManager.loadConfig();\n          this.baseURL = this.buildBaseURL();\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 服务发现客户端\n```typescript\nclass ServiceDiscoveryClient {\n  private knownPorts: number[];\n  private currentPort: number;\n  private currentHost: string;\n  \n  constructor() {\n    this.knownPorts = [18789, 3000, 8080, 443, 80, 3001, 3002];\n    this.currentHost = 'localhost';\n    this.currentPort = this.knownPorts[0];\n  }\n  \n  async discover(): Promise<void> {\n    for (const port of this.knownPorts) {\n      try {\n        const isReachable = await this.checkPort(port);\n        if (isReachable) {\n          this.currentPort = port;\n          console.log(`Discovered OpenClaw on port ${port}`);\n          return;\n        }\n      } catch (error) {\n        // 继续尝试下一个端口\n        continue;\n      }\n    }\n    \n    throw new Error('Cannot discover OpenClaw service');\n  }\n  \n  async checkPort(port: number): Promise<boolean> {\n    try {\n      const response = await fetch(`http://localhost:${port}/api/health`, {\n        method: 'GET',\n        timeout: 2000,\n      });\n      \n      // 即使404也认为服务存在（可能是旧版本）\n      return response.status !== 0;\n    } catch (error) {\n      return false;\n    }\n  }\n  \n  getBaseURL(): string {\n    return `http://${this.currentHost}:${this.currentPort}/api/v1`;\n  }\n  \n  // 定期重新发现服务\n  startAutoDiscovery(intervalMs: number = 30000) {\n    setInterval(async () => {\n      try {\n        await this.discover();\n      } catch (error) {\n        console.warn('Auto-discovery failed:', error);\n      }\n    }, intervalMs);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🧪 测试策略\n\n### 多端口测试套件\n```typescript\ndescribe('OpenClaw Multi-Port Integration', () => {\n  const testPorts = [18789, 3000, 8080, 3001, 3002];\n  \n  testPorts.forEach(port => {\n    it(`should connect to OpenClaw on port ${port}`, async () => {\n      const client = new AdaptiveOpenClawClient();\n      \n      // 模拟该端口的配置\n      process.env.OPENCLAW_PORT = port.toString();\n      client['configManager'].loadConfig();\n      \n      try {\n        const response = await client.request('health');\n        expect(response).toHaveProperty('status', 'ok');\n      } catch (error) {\n        // 端口可能未开放，这不是测试失败\n        if (error.code === 'ECONNREFUSED') {\n          console.log(`Port ${port} not available (expected)`);\n        } else {\n          throw error;\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 配置变更测试\n```typescript\ndescribe('Configuration Change Handling', () => {\n  it('should adapt to port changes dynamically', async () => {\n    const client = new AdaptiveOpenClawClient();\n    \n    // 初始配置\n    process.env.OPENCLAW_PORT = '18789';\n    client['configManager'].loadConfig();\n    \n    // 模拟配置变更\n    process.env.OPENCLAW_PORT = '3000';\n    client['configManager'].loadConfig();\n    \n    expect(client['baseURL']).toBe('http://localhost:3000/api/v1');\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## 📊 监控和日志\n\n### 端口使用监控\n```typescript\ninterface PortUsageMetrics {\n  port: number;\n  success: boolean;\n  responseTime: number;\n  timestamp: Date;\n  error?: string;\n}\n\nclass PortMonitor {\n  private metrics: PortUsageMetrics[] = [];\n  \n  async testPort(port: number): Promise<PortUsageMetrics> {\n    const startTime = Date.now();\n    \n    try {\n      const response = await fetch(`http://localhost:${port}/api/health`, {\n        timeout: 5000,\n      });\n      \n      const metrics: PortUsageMetrics = {\n        port,\n        success: response.ok,\n        responseTime: Date.now() - startTime,\n        timestamp: new Date(),\n      };\n      \n      this.metrics.push(metrics);\n      return metrics;\n      \n    } catch (error) {\n      const metrics: PortUsageMetrics = {\n        port,\n        success: false,\n        responseTime: Date.now() - startTime,\n        timestamp: new Date(),\n        error: error.message,\n      };\n      \n      this.metrics.push(metrics);\n      return metrics;\n    }\n  }\n  \n  getOptimalPort(): number {\n    const successful = this.metrics.filter(m => m.success);\n    if (successful.length === 0) {\n      throw new Error('No successful port connections');\n    }\n    \n    // 选择响应时间最短的端口\n    return successful.reduce((best, current) => \n      current.responseTime < best.responseTime ? current : best\n    ).port;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🚀 部署配置\n\n### Docker多端口暴露\n```yaml\nversion: '3.8'\nservices:\n  ai-soul-weaver:\n    image: ai-soul-weaver:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    environment:\n      - OPENCLAW_AUTO_DISCOVERY=true\n      - OPENCLAW_KNOWN_PORTS=18789,3000,8080,3001,3002\n      - OPENCLAW_DISCOVERY_INTERVAL=30000\n\n  openclaw-gateway:\n    image: openclaw/gateway:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"18789:18789\"\n      - \"3000:18789\"  # 备用端口映射\n      - \"8080:18789\"  # 另一个备用端口\n```\n\n### Kubernetes服务发现\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: openclaw-discovery\ndata:\n  known-ports: \"18789,3000,8080,3001,3002\"\n  discovery-interval: \"30000\"\n  auto-discovery: \"true\"\n---\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: ai-soul-weaver\nspec:\n  template:\n    spec:\n      containers:\n      - name: ai-soul-weaver\n        env:\n        - name: OPENCLAW_KNOWN_PORTS\n          valueFrom:\n            configMapKeyRef:\n              name: openclaw-discovery\n              key"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":85290,"output":4096,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89386,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"length","timestamp":1772891248451}}
